        "Title": "Mission 4: The Betrayal",
        "Location": "LOCATION_WET_RAT",
        "PublicId": "130360969560",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/wet/scene_rat_basic.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 006e46cf-afb8-47af-bd88-905d574c6e8b).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, 47.\r\rAfter Berlin, we uncovered evidence that elements within the ICA are using there clearance level to supply intelligence to the Sheikh and his allies. This betrayal cannot stand and must be dealt with. Because your presence would raise suspicion, you will infiltrate the ICA Chongqing field office covertly.\r\rEliminate the informants and their internal handler to sever the flow of intelligence.\r\rDo not harm uninvolved ICA personnel during the operation.\r\rGood hunting, 47.",
